16yg|n|A considerable collection of books kept for use, and not as merchandise; as, a private library; a public library. ; A building or apartment appropriated for holding such a collection of books.	a:kj1,76,16;bqg,71,7;1o03,64,21;17jw,64,12;1f8t,41,2;1gpw,14,3~1o03,64,21;kj1,76,16;17jw,64,12;bqg,71,7;1gpw,14,3;1f8t,41,2	n:1f8t,46,3;27fd,41,17~27fd,41,17;1f8t,46,3	N:v65,113,4~v65,113,4
