178f|v|To connect or unite with a link or as with a link; to join; to attach; to unite; to couple. ; To be connected.	o:1sjv,43,1~1sjv,43,1	s:iaj,20,1;296p,13,4~296p,13,4;iaj,20,1	d:2hq,8,8~2hq,8,8	D:62p,12,11;kt1,8,4~62p,12,11;kt1,8,4
