17ce|a|According to the letter or verbal expression; real; not figurative or metaphorical; as, the literal meaning of a phrase. ; Following the letter or exact words; not free. ; Consisting of, or expressed by, letters. ; Giving a strict or literal construction; unimaginative; matter-of fast; -- applied to persons.	j:2519,97,6;19iq,75,4;1pn3,59,4;1v2e,57,3;1ovy,18,3~2519,97,6;19iq,75,4;1pn3,59,4;1ovy,18,3;1v2e,57,3	e:1gg0,98,7~1gg0,98,7
