17dd|n|A metallic element of the alkaline group, occurring in several minerals, as petalite, spodumene, lepidolite, triphylite, etc., and otherwise widely disseminated, though in small quantities.	a:2alz,102,7~2alz,102,7	N:13z6,164,5;wgw,111,3~13z6,164,5;wgw,111,3
